<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Bring a guest to ISF Forum 2026 on us</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Book a Delegate or VIP pass and your guest comes along at no extra cost until 1 November.</mj-preview>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" />
      <mj-section padding="0px" />
      <mj-column padding="0px" />
      <mj-image padding="0px" />
      <mj-text color="#222222" font-size="16px" line-height="1.65" padding="0 36px 16px 36px" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      a { color: #1E6F64; }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#F2F4F3" width="600px">

    <!-- Top line -->
    <mj-section padding="22px 0 10px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" line-height="1.5" color="#5E6B68" align="center" padding="0 24px">ISF Forum 2026 &middot; 27 and 28 November &middot; ICC Ibadan</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Header photo -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="6px 6px 0 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://theisfforum.com/editions/panel-wide.jpg" width="600px" border-radius="6px 6px 0 0" href="https://theisfforum.com/forum" alt="A panel session on the main stage at ISF Summit 2024, International Conference Centre, Ibadan" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Letter -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="34px 0 6px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Hi {{firstName}},</mj-text>
        <mj-text>You are receiving this because you have been in touch with the ISF Forum team by email since we started in 2022. Thank you for being part of the story.</mj-text>
        <mj-text>That first Forum was 500 people in one room. This year we expect 3,000 founders, investors, bankers and policymakers from more than 20 countries at the International Conference Centre in Ibadan on 27 and 28 November.</mj-text>
        <mj-text>On stage: Iyin Aboyeji, co-founder of Andela and Flutterwave; Chika Nwosu of PalmPay; Kashifu Inuwa Abdullahi of NITDA; Claire Lavielle of Chapter54; and more than 50 others, with Governor Seyi Makinde as host. Friday brings two accelerator finals and a networking reception. Saturday ends with the Gala Dinner and 18 awards presented live.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Offer -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 36px 8px 36px">
      <mj-column background-color="#EEF6F4" border-radius="6px" padding="22px 0 6px 0">
        <mj-text font-size="13px" font-weight="700" color="#1E6F64" padding="0 24px 6px 24px">For people who have been with us before</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="17px" line-height="1.55" color="#0F1F1D" padding="0 24px 12px 24px">Book a Delegate (&#8358;75,000) or VIP (&#8358;150,000) pass and bring a guest on the same pass at no extra cost.</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="1.6" color="#3E4B48" padding="0 24px 16px 24px">After you book, reply to this email with your guest's name and we will send their pass. The offer runs until Delegate and VIP passes close on 1 November.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="18px 0 8px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-button href="https://tickets.theisfforum.com/#/buyTickets/selectTickets?lang=en" background-color="#1E6F64" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="16px" font-weight="700" border-radius="4px" inner-padding="14px 30px" align="left" padding="0 36px 22px 36px">Book your pass and bring a guest</mj-button>
        <mj-text>The full programme and speaker list are on <a href="https://theisfforum.com/forum" style="color:#1E6F64;text-decoration:underline;">the ISF Forum website</a>.</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="6px 36px 34px 36px">See you in Ibadan,<br />David Adeleke<br /><span style="color:#5E6B68;">Convener, ISF Forum</span></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- FIXED BOTTOM: Ibadan banner -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="0 0 6px 6px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DaxlinksG/email-templates/isf-newsletter-assets/isf-2026/speakers-oct/isf-big-ideas-banner.jpg" width="600px" border-radius="0 0 6px 6px" href="https://theisfforum.com/forum" alt="ISF Forum 2026 banner showing the Ibadan skyline" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <mj-section padding="22px 0 30px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" line-height="1.6" color="#666666" align="center" padding="0 32px 6px 32px">ISF Forum &middot; Ibadan, Oyo State, Nigeria</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" line-height="1.6" color="#666666" align="center" padding="0 32px 6px 32px">You are receiving this email because you have corresponded with the ISF Forum team.</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" line-height="1.6" color="#666666" align="center" padding="0 32px"><a href="{{UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}" style="color:#666666;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

  </mj-body>
</mjml>
